Description: Classic Parcheesi browser game for a local network
 A multiplayer Parcheesi game with computer opponents, animated pieces,
 nine translated rules pages, sound, and a Victory Hall. Runs a dedicated
 systemd service on TCP port 8080; players join with a web browser.
